sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant I as Issues
    participant DB as Issues DB
    participant P as Publisher
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notifications
    FE->>I: PATCH status + expectedStatus
    I->>DB: BEGIN; lock Issue; read status
    alt Target already set
      I->>DB: End transaction; release lock
      I-->>FE: 200; no new History
    else Conflict or invalid transition
      I->>DB: ROLLBACK
      I-->>FE: 409
    else Valid transition
      I->>DB: UPDATE Issue + INSERT History; COMMIT
      I-->>FE: 200 Issue
      P->>DB: Read unpublished History
      P->>Q: issue.status_changed
      Q-->>P: Confirm + route checked
      P->>DB: Set History.published_at
      Q-->>N: Event → own DB → Telegram → own DB → ACK
    end
